{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-shower-jsd10-sold-via-amazon-2601-0194","content_id":"5c1d95b9-9a6e-4989-b95e-f28f2d6061ce","description":"Product Safety Report for Shower JSD10 presenting a high risk of fire.\r\n","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"1f086f67-3e77-4823-8b7d-136adb189ee0","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-14T18:15:53+01:00","id":"1f086f67-3e77-4823-8b7d-136adb189ee0","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-08-14T18:15:53+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7f4d4903b4fe14b1e7decd/2601-0194-product-safety-report-shower-JSD10.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Shower JSD10 sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: There is no evidence that the product has been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures, as the supplied Declaration of Conformity did not match the product.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Tankless Water Heaters</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>JSD10</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Zhongshan Aokesi Kitchen and Bathroom Electrical Appliance Co., Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other product identifiers</td>\n      <td>UV 7, RVG17153-250910-0001-633, G17153-Z9023370408</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A gas boiler water heater for use as a shower unit.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_1f086f67-3e77-4823-8b7d-136adb189ee0\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7f4d4903b4fe14b1e7decd/2601-0194-product-safety-report-shower-JSD10.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>There is no evidence that the product has been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures, as the supplied Declaration of Conformity did not match the product. There is no valid technical documentation for the product and no evidence of production control. There is a lack of labelling, marking and instructions. In the absence of evidence to demonstrate the conformity of the product, it may be possible for the product to overheat and catch fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2601-0194</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-17T09:29:56Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-17","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-17T10:29:56+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-shower-jsd10-sold-via-amazon-2601-0194","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-shower-jsd10-sold-via-amazon-2601-0194","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-shower-jsd10-sold-via-amazon-2601-0194","content_id":"5c1d95b9-9a6e-4989-b95e-f28f2d6061ce","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-17T09:29:56Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Shower JSD10 sold via Amazon (2601-0194)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-shower-jsd10-sold-via-amazon-2601-0194","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are","short_name":"R